        <h2>How Our Chickens Live</h2>
        <p>Our chickens are allowed to scratch, forage, dust-bathe, hunt insects, and explore outdoors. They also receive organic poultry feed to support their health and egg production.</p>
        <p>Pasture-raised and organic feed describe different parts of the system. We are describing the feed we choose, not claiming USDA Organic certification for our eggs unless that certification is in place.</p>
        <p>Eggs are seasonal and currently sold out. Production changes with daylight, weather, molting, flock size, and what the hens are actually laying.</p>
